flowchart LR
    Dev[Developer] -->|Pull request / push| GitHub[GitHub repository]
    GitHub --> Actions[GitHub Actions]
    Actions --> Tests[Tests + Ruff + Bandit]
    Actions --> Secrets[Gitleaks]
    Actions --> FS[Trivy filesystem]
    Actions --> Build[BuildKit container build]
    Build --> ImageScan[Trivy image scan]
    Build --> GHCR[GHCR immutable SHA tag]
    GHCR --> Deploy[Manual protected deployment]

    subgraph AWS[AWS account]
      VPC[VPC]
      Public[Public subnets]
      Private[Private subnets]
      NAT[NAT Gateway]
      EKS[EKS control plane]
      Nodes[Managed node group]
      Pods[Kubernetes pods]
      VPC --> Public
      VPC --> Private
      Private --> NAT
      EKS --> Nodes
      Nodes --> Pods
      Pods -->|Outbound only| NAT
    end

    Terraform[Terraform] --> VPC
    Terraform --> EKS
    Deploy --> Pods
    Pods -->|/health /ready /metrics| Monitor[Prometheus / Grafana]
